  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Line P - Phytoplankton Productivity Data, 1999-present",
  "description": "Primary productivity data along Line P and Station P for Sept 1999, and March and June 2000. Chlorophyll, primary productivity, chlorophyll fluorescence, photosynthetically active radiation, and phytoplankton abundance and biomass were measured.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Assessing the variability of primary production along Line P, constructing models to predict parameters of phytoplankton population and biomass.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Data not secured in regional data centre . Risk of Loss: Medium Impact Justification: Time series of less than 5 years. Impact of Loss: Low Recommended Action: Obtain access to data and bring to archives",
